APTSERVER - serve the apt catalog over rednet
Usage: aptserver [--dir <catalog dir>] [--quiet]

Publishes this computer's package catalog (etc/packages) to every other
CloverOS machine on the rednet. Clients add it as a source:

  apt add-source rednet <computer id>
  apt update
  apt install <package>

The same sha256 integrity rules apply as for GitHub sources: digests are
published in the index and enforced before anything is written. The server
runs until terminated (ctrl+T).

Examples:
  aptserver
  aptserver --quiet
